{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Recognise the Republic of China (Taiwan) as an independent sovereign state",
        "additional_details": "The Republic of China (Taiwan) is a self-governing democracy with its own constitution, military, and elected government. It is a vital global trade partner and technology hub in the Indo-Pacific. Despite sharing democratic values with the UK, it lacks formal diplomatic recognition from the UK Government. In our view, recognising the Republic of China (Taiwan) would reflect international reality, strengthen economic ties, and demonstrate commitment to global democracy and rule of law.",
        "background": "The Republic of China (Taiwan) is a self-governing democracy. We believe recognising it reflects global reality and strengthens UK trade and security ties. \r\nWe call on the UK Government to grant diplomatic recognition to the Republic of China (Taiwan) as an independent sovereign state.",
